{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-03-18 06:30:00', 'title': 'PIAGGIO FAST FORWARD AND TRIMBLE ANNOUNCE PROOF-OF-CONCEPT COLLABORATION TO UTILIZE PROPRIETARY SMART FOLLOWING TECHNOLOGY', 'text': 'BOSTON\xa0AND SUNNYVALE, CALIF., MARCH 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PIAGGIO FAST FORWARD\xa0(PFF), A LEADER IN SMART FOLLOWING TECHNOLOGY AND SUBSIDIARY OF THE PIAGGIO GROUP (PIA.MI), AND TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY A PROOF-OF-CONCEPT COLLABORATION TO ENABLE ROBOTS AND MACHINES TO FOLLOW HUMANS AND OTHER MACHINES IN INDUSTRIAL APPLICATIONS.'}